## 3. Repository 实现规范

### 强制要求
- Repository 实现类用 `@Inject constructor` 注入依赖
- 所有 IO 操作（网络、数据库、文件）使用 `@IODispatcher`
- 返回类型统一用 `Result<T>`，不使用 `throw`
- 本地缓存优先策略：读取时先查本地，再请求网络
- 分页数据用 `PagingSource` + `RemoteMediator`，不用一次性加载

### 正确写法
```kotlin
class ChatRepositoryImpl @Inject constructor(
    private val api: ChatApi,
    private val dao: MessageDao,
    @IODispatcher private val ioDispatcher: CoroutineDispatcher
) : ChatRepository {

    override suspend fun getMessages(): Result<List<Message>> = runCatching {
        withContext(ioDispatcher) {
            // 1. 先读缓存
            val cached = dao.getMessages().ifEmpty {
                // 2. 缓存为空，请求网络
                val remote = api.getMessages().also { msgs ->
                    dao.insertMessages(msgs) // 写缓存
                }
                remote
            }
            cached
        }
    }

    override suspend fun sendMessage(text: String): Result<Message> = runCatching {
        withContext(ioDispatcher) {
            val msg = api.sendMessage(SendMessageRequest(text))
            dao.insertMessage(msg) // 乐观更新本地缓存
            msg
        }
    }
}
```

